## Spelling application

### Read out, list of words, check

UI small to medium

Read out - Word, phonetically, Context ie in a sentence
List of Words - List, Sub-list, Duplicate remove for the List, Learnt words remove, Correctly spelt words in List
Check - Incorrect recorded, Correct recorded, Reveal, Keyboard, Pen and paper, Do with Sub-list ie reuse or disregard

Rilla - letters could go green when correct or red if wrong while you are typing ie wordle
Look, Cover, Write, Check

